    6~mL module with an additively manufactured Al#sub[2]O#sub[3] bench and lid. The
    fiber-coupled optical system, rubidium vapor cell, micro-optical
    components, and photodiode are integrated directly on the printed
    ceramic bench. A one-euro-cent coin is shown for scale. (b)
    Overlapping Allan deviation of the beat-note frequency between a
    laser stabilized to the CerAMRef and an independent rubidium
